Name       : efl_affirm
Auto-designing: Take n cliques, each built from exactly n vertices, where any two of the cliques share at most one vertex between them. Merge all of their vertices and edges into one graph. Assign every vertex a color out of n available colors so that no edge joins two vertices of the same color. This coloring always succeeds with only n colors, no matter how the cliques are arranged or how they overlap.

